{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":9,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":362,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1912789,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284874,"Name":"smfahey","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1460392446,"LastPoster":{"Id":286819,"Name":"happyfiance","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1912789,"PostDate":1460392446,"PostContent":"Hello, \u00a0 I am in the beginning stages of planning my wedding at Barcel\u00f3 Maya Colonial for Februar...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stasia2914@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.73.80.191","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442779509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"smfahey","Id":284874,"Name":"smfahey","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"168.208.215.217","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80036,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8bf17dc1c08b39dba1e665b42355b301","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am in the beginning stages of planning my wedding at Barcel\u00f3 Maya Colonial for February 25th, 2017.&amp;nbsp; Although, I am extremely excited about this adventure we have decided to take I am also extremely nervous and stressed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Unfortunately, I am one of those people that like everything planned out ahead of time and have a million spreadsheets all over the place for each project area (Ridiculous I know)!!&amp;nbsp; My dilemma now is that a lot of flights aren&#039;t out so we need to wait to start reserving ceremony location and all the other fine details.&amp;nbsp; Besides the fact that it takes FOREVER to get a response back from a planner at the hotel, anyone else have this issue?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I would love to hear back from past brides that got married here or had a good\/bad experience so I can filter out some of those details now.&amp;nbsp; I would also LOVE to hear from other brides that are getting married in 2017 so we can compare stories\/notes along the way.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Stacy&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912789,"PostDate":1460392446,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am in the beginning stages of planning my wedding at Barcel\u00f3 Maya Colonial for February 25th, 2017.\u00a0 Although, I am extremely excited about this adventure we have decided to take I am also extremely nervous and stressed.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Unfortunately, I am one of those people that like everything planned out ahead of time and have a million spreadsheets all over the place for each project area (Ridiculous I know)!!\u00a0 My dilemma now is that a lot of flights aren't out so we need to wait to start reserving ceremony location and all the other fine details.\u00a0 Besides the fact that it takes FOREVER to get a response back from a planner at the hotel, anyone else have this issue?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would love to hear back from past brides that got married here or had a good\/bad experience so I can filter out some of those details now.\u00a0 I would also LOVE to hear from other brides that are getting married in 2017 so we can compare stories\/notes along the way.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!<\/p>\n<p>Stacy<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stasia2914@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.73.80.191","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442779509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"smfahey","Id":284874,"Name":"smfahey","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.32.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80036,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e22a2d94165786af956a2e42d1393bd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"smfahey\"] you have selected a Great hotel, and its only normal to feel nervous and stressed!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;About your hotel coordinator taking forever , this is quite common with the resort. because their policy to respond is 72 hours. Make no mistake your wedding is just as important. Please bear in mind they are outside daily coordinating weddings, and only have short time frame to respond. &amp;nbsp;I can assure you, as the months passes by you will start to see movements.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have wedding at Barcelo this June, and so far my clients are happy. the have selected the mint breeze package and I using the resort vendors.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Joyce&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912792,"PostDate":1460404405,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284874\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284874-smfahey\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">smfahey<\/span><\/a> you have selected a Great hotel, and its only normal to feel nervous and stressed!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>About your hotel coordinator taking forever , this is quite common with the resort. because their policy to respond is 72 hours. Make no mistake your wedding is just as important. Please bear in mind they are outside daily coordinating weddings, and only have short time frame to respond. \u00a0I can assure you, as the months passes by you will start to see movements.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have wedding at Barcelo this June, and so far my clients are happy. the have selected the mint breeze package and I using the resort vendors.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n<p>Joyce\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"168.208.215.217","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80036,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7df84b0e08105dd451d918206f267e33","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"dreamweddings\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much for the feedback!!! Now that pricing is coming out for flights I&#039;m getting more and more excited :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912804,"PostDate":1460457745,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"250090\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/250090-dreamweddings\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">dreamweddings<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much for the feedback!!! Now that pricing is coming out for flights I'm getting more and more excited <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stasia2914@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.73.80.191","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442779509,"Photo":{"HasPho