rocess.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.66.4.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80036,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b79390074bc0bc27fca9f7506be0bd0b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our helpful forum community Stacy, and Congrats on your Feb 25 wedding next year at the Barcelo Maya Colonial!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We captured a Feb 25, 2015 wedding there which was absolutely Gorgeous.......here&#039;s what we&#039;re talking about: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Barcelo-Palace-Wedding\/k7mfu\/56796a140cf28854b38fcb37&#039;&gt;Feb 25, 2015 wedding at Barcelo Maya Colonial Wedding Story Album&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/a&gt;with some excerpts here....enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_c0ae5dbf18514ef9b10bcfcd65ce2b16.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1249,h_833,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_c0ae5dbf18514ef9b10bcfcd65ce2b16.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_c0ae5dbf18514ef9b10bcfcd65ce2b16.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_b0779e8c2eae48c986da2dd056cc1ff0.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1249,h_833,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_b0779e8c2eae48c986da2dd056cc1ff0.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_b0779e8c2eae48c986da2dd056cc1ff0.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_534b9ef4275b4dc3bc13a1fbb4ffc0e1.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1249,h_833,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_534b9ef4275b4dc3bc13a1fbb4ffc0e1.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_534b9ef4275b4dc3bc13a1fbb4ffc0e1.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So you can see the backdrops for your wedding day photos is Beautiful!!! Hope it all works out just the way you dream of - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912836,"PostDate":1460557096,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our helpful forum community Stacy, and Congrats on your Feb 25 wedding next year at the Barcelo Maya Colonial!!!<\/p>\n<p>We captured a Feb 25, 2015 wedding there which was absolutely Gorgeous.......here's what we're talking about: <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Barcelo-Palace-Wedding\/k7mfu\/56796a140cf28854b38fcb37' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Feb 25, 2015 wedding at Barcelo Maya Colonial Wedding Story Album\u00a0 <\/a>with some excerpts here....enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_c0ae5dbf18514ef9b10bcfcd65ce2b16.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1249,h_833,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_c0ae5dbf18514ef9b10bcfcd65ce2b16.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_c0ae5dbf18514ef9b10bcfcd65ce2b16.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_b0779e8c2eae48c986da2dd056cc1ff0.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1249,h_833,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_b0779e8c2eae48c986da2dd056cc1ff0.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_b0779e8c2eae48c986da2dd056cc1ff0.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_534b9ef4275b4dc3bc13a1fbb4ffc0e1.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1249,h_833,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_534b9ef4275b4dc3bc13a1fbb4ffc0e1.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_534b9ef4275b4dc3bc13a1fbb4ffc0e1.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So you can see the backdrops for your wedding day photos is Beautiful!!! Hope it all works out just the way you dream of - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.99.133.32","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80036,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by happyfiance, 28 April 2016 - 01:34 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1461850461,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec01f51b51d8e312e69cf11bddba6a5e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"smfahey\"],&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Did Barcelo reply back to you?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also send out an email in regards to booking a wedding venue to Barcelo Maya Colonial however it&#039;s been two weeks with no reply or any contact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;any suggestion?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;need help&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;thank you,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;happyfiance&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913166,"PostDate":1461850361,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284874\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284874-smfahey\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">smfahey<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did Barcelo reply back to you?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also send out an email in regards to booking a wedding venue to Barcelo Maya Colonial however it's been two weeks with no reply or any contact.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>any suggestion?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>need help\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>thank you,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>happyfiance<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abegailandpascal@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.99.133.32","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1461672240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"happyfiance","Id":286819,"Name":"happyfiance","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.32.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80036,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ff8d4bfb3613dca852891814e863841f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"happyfiance\" post=\"1913166\" timestamp=\"1461864761\"]\nHi @[member=\"smfahey\"],\n\nDid Barcelo reply back to you?\n\nI also send out an email in regards to booking a wedding venue to Barcelo Maya Colonial however it&#039;s been two weeks with no reply or any contact. \n\nany suggestion? \nneed help \n\n\nthank you,\n\nhappyfiance[\/quote]@[member=\"happyfiance\"] being that April and May are the most popular for weddings, I can only imagine the resorts wedding coordinators are out all day coordinating weddings.  I would definitely email them again. sometimes emails just sits in the spam folder :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1913181,"PostDate":1461888419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>happyfiance, on 28 April 2016 - 01:32 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284874\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284874-smfahey\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">smfahey<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did Barcelo reply back to you?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also send out an email in regards to booking a wedding venue to Barcelo Maya Colonial however it's been two weeks with no reply or any contact.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>any suggestion?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>need help\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>thank you,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>happyfiance<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286819\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/286819-happyfiance\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">happyfiance<\/span><\/a> being that April and May are the most popular for weddings, I can only imagine the resorts wedding coordinators are out all day coordinating weddings. \u00a0I would definitely email them again. sometimes emails just sits in the spam folder <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"168.208.215.217","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80036,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fdb17ad224db42fcbfaa3de1f4e5e758","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"happyfiance\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I did finally get a response.&amp;nbsp; It is however nerve racking waiting to hear back from someone.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Did you get ahold of someone?&amp;nbsp; When are you planning on getting married in 2017?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Stacy :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913974,"PostDate":1464022143,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286819\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/286819-happyfiance\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">happyfiance<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I did finally get a response.\u00a0 It is however nerve racking waiting to hear back from someone.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you get ahold of someone?\u00a0 When are you planning on getting married in 2017?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Stacy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stasia2914@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.73.80.191","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442779509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"smfahey","Id":284874,"Name":"smfahey","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.99.133.32","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80036,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4dfacc462460a74275c0d7f955fe491a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi &lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284874-smfahey\/\" title=\"\"&gt;smfahey&lt;\/a&gt;,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yes, they finally reply back to me :) &amp;nbsp;Her name is Christian J. &amp;nbsp;I am just waiting for my travel agent for Itinerary so that I can confirm my wedding date for now it on hold.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My wedding date is &amp;nbsp;Aug 2017 :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning and have fun&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Abegail&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914033,"PostDate":1464274692,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284874-smfahey\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>smfahey<\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yes, they finally reply back to me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0Her name is Christian J. \u00a0I am just waiting for my travel agent for Itinerary so that I can confirm my wedding date for now it on hold.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My wedding date is \u00a0Aug 2017 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning and have fun\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Abegail<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abegailandpascal@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.99.133.32","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1461672240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"happyfiance","Id":286819,"Name":"happyfiance","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80036","Title":"Barcelo Maya Colonial Wedding Feb 2017","LastPostDate":1464274692},"Pages":{"TotalItems":9,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
