Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.35.40.254","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78054,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c55fb92bfba7956a2da8f421b5ed566","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Anybody been? Vacation? Attended a wedding?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Love? Hate?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;ALL the details! Even if it&#039;s just to say you saw it from the plane. ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872395,"PostDate":1411160622,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Anybody been? Vacation? Attended a wedding?<\/p>\n<p>Love? Hate?<\/p>\n<p>ALL the details! Even if it's just to say you saw it from the plane. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407859786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.31.106.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78054,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6349df5777c7e1afd2d375f6fd82dee7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Mangosong\"] - I don&#039;t have many details but my girlfriend took her husband there for his birthday a couple of months ago. From her photos the hotel and location are beautiful. They really had a good time from the pictures. They took beautiful pictures of the hotel, food, sunsets and activities. For my wedding I chose a different location in Costa Rica but this one looks really nice.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872602,"PostDate":1411379433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279411\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279411-mangosong\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mangosong<\/span><\/a> - I don't have many details but my girlfriend took her husband there for his birthday a couple of months ago. From her photos the hotel and location are beautiful. They really had a good time from the pictures. They took beautiful pictures of the hotel, food, sunsets and activities. For my wedding I chose a different location in Costa Rica but this one looks really nice.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409076707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.161.204.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78054,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cbacdffa4f8325325afa3b77a0ea7af1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your dw in Costa Rica, Mangosong!!! &amp;nbsp;in case you haven&#039;t already seen them, here&#039;s a link to &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/71-costa-rica-weddings\/&#039;&gt;some threads with info on Costa Rico weddings&lt;\/a&gt; you may find helpful.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration showing the beauty of a beach wedding, here&#039;s a visual to get your creativity flowing.....enjoy :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-c-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1618120_10152265848279487_1607472971_o.jpg\" alt=\"1618120_10152265848279487_1607472971_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;there&#039;s more where that came from here.....&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;MTM fb Cover photos&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872626,"PostDate":1411386106,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your dw in Costa Rica, Mangosong!!! \u00a0in case you haven't already seen them, here's a link to <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/71-costa-rica-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>some threads with info on Costa Rico weddings<\/a> you may find helpful.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration showing the beauty of a beach wedding, here's a visual to get your creativity flowing.....enjoy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-c-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1618120_10152265848279487_1607472971_o.jpg\" alt=\"1618120_10152265848279487_1607472971_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>there's more where that came from here.....<a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>MTM fb Cover photos<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.35.40.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78054,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4d41eec7da8509ea863e1021f34b3d1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"puravida2015\"] Where are you doing in Costa Rica? I think we are set on Costa Rica, but we&#039;re not 100% comitted to Occidental, yet.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;\n@[member=\"Moments That Matter\"] Thanks for the link! I was searching for a Costa Rica section on the board but couldn&#039;t seem to find it!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872728,"PostDate":1411421101,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279580-puravida2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">puravida2015<\/span><\/a> Where are you doing in Costa Rica? I think we are set on Costa Rica, but we're not 100% comitted to Occidental, yet.<\/p>\n<br \/><p>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"230711\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/230711-moments-that-matter\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Moments That Matter<\/span><\/a> Thanks for the link! I was searching for a Costa Rica section on the board but couldn't seem to find it!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407859786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.227.239.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78054,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34c07bde7b0faae90944a6781d9da24e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Mangosong\"] I will be at Dreams Las Mareas in Playa El Jobo. It&#039;s at the very northern tip of Guanacaste. It&#039;s a new Dreams resort opening this November. I chose this one because 1) I&#039;ve always wanted to go to Costa Rica, 2) Dreams has a pretty good reputation for destination weddings 3) I prefer newer properties and wanted something all-inclusive.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you want a secluded location this one is very secluded. If you prefer to be in a more tourist area then I would head further south in Guanacaste. &amp;nbsp;Good luck to you. Let us know what you decide on!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872778,"PostDate":1411461775,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279411\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279411-mangosong\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mangosong<\/span><\/a> I will be at Dreams Las Mareas in Playa El Jobo. It's at the very northern tip of Guanacaste. It's a new Dreams resort opening this November. I chose this one because 1) I've always wanted to go to Costa Rica, 2) Dreams has a pretty good reputation for destination weddings 3) I prefer newer properties and wanted something all-inclusive.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you want a secluded location this one is very secluded. If you prefer to be in a more tourist area then I would head further south in Guanacaste. \u00a0Good luck to you. Let us know what you decide on!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409076707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.35.40.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78054,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"49b81347738f1b52ba73c96e7eb42e7e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"puravida2015\"] Thanks so much! I&#039;m going to look into it!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872897,"PostDate":1411504970,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_ho