{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":70296,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f597109698e51cc8409c07f6a3a0657f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My fin ace and I are getting married December 2013. We have 6 resorts on our list and are having a tough time deciding which one is the one for us.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are considering:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Barcelo Los Cabos&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Dreams Puerta Vallarta&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Occidental Grande Cozumel&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Park Roayl Cozumel&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Magestic Colonial Punta Cana&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Blue Ocean and Sand Punta Cana.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Has anyone been to a wedding at any of these resorts and have any opinions they would care to share with me?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div id=\"myEventWatcherDiv\" style=\"display:none;\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1681126,"PostDate":1351695231,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My fin ace and I are getting married December 2013. We have 6 resorts on our list and are having a tough time deciding which one is the one for us.<\/p> <p> We are considering:<\/p> <p> Barcelo Los Cabos<\/p> <p> Dreams Puerta Vallarta<\/p> <p> Occidental Grande Cozumel<\/p> <p> Park Roayl Cozumel<\/p> <p> Magestic Colonial Punta Cana<\/p> <p> Blue Ocean and Sand Punta Cana.<\/p> <p> Has anyone been to a wedding at any of these resorts and have any opinions they would care to share with me?<\/p> <div id=\"myEventWatcherDiv\"  style=\"display:none\"> \u00a0<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberkerr@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351548434,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261898.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"APNK","Id":261898,"Name":"APNK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":70296,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df87c2f0c04d2f14521b7af25b60d228","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats APNK ! + welcome to our forum community :) to help wedding couples decide which resort is the right pick for them, we&#039;ve compiled a webpage with tips for choosing the right resort - with a link here......&lt;img data-id=\"169885\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169885\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1681517,"PostDate":1351786879,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats APNK ! + welcome to our forum community <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> to help wedding couples decide which resort is the right pick for them, we've compiled a webpage with tips for choosing the right resort - with a link here......<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169885\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169885\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":70296,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b02b093a76a1d32b1c188330d5d5096","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello APNK!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Congratulations!!! Have you ever thought about a wedding in Riviera Maya? We\u00b4ve got beautiful beaches, great weather and stunning views. Maybe Riviera Maya is were you might want to go! For more information visit: www.rivieramaya.com&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Enjoy all your wedding preparations and we hope you have the wedding you always dreamed of!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1683145,"PostDate":1352211292,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello APNK!!<\/p> <p> Congratulations!!! Have you ever thought about a wedding in Riviera Maya? We\u00b4ve got beautiful beaches, great weather and stunning views. Maybe Riviera Maya is were you might want to go! For more information visit: www.rivieramaya.com<\/p> <p> Enjoy all your wedding preparations and we hope you have the wedding you always dreamed of!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"weddings@hotellereve.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1268416124,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226399.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":126,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Le Reve Hotel & Spa","Id":226399,"Name":"Le Reve Hotel & Spa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":70296,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0fd1f4eea2dda43d1aad29e25d455f12","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We live on Cozumel, so we are a little biased. The Occidental Grand is very nice and has good reports about their food. The same goes for the Park Royal (it is closer to town). However, the Occidental would provide an open ocean backdrop for your wedding, while the Park Royal beach looks out at the cruise ship pier and a harbor with anchored boats.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We would choose Cozumel for the variety of water sports that the island offers: diving and snorkeling on the west and south side; bone fishing, kayaking or kite boarding on the northwest side; and miles of undeveloped beaches on the east side.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Plus, the Caribbean is warm and clear unlike the colder waters of the Pacific.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Good luck,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; M&amp;amp;J&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1683536,"PostDate":1352292314,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We live on Cozumel, so we are a little biased. The Occidental Grand is very nice and has good reports about their food. The same goes for the Park Royal (it is closer to town). However, the Occidental would provide an open ocean backdrop for your wedding, while the Park Royal beach looks out at the cruise ship pier and a harbor with anchored boats.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We would choose Cozumel for the variety of water sports that the island offers: diving and snorkeling on the west and south side; bone fishing, kayaking or kite boarding on the northwest side; and miles of undeveloped beaches on the east side.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Plus, the Caribbean is warm and clear unlike the colder waters of the Pacific.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck,<\/p> <p> M&J<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@mandjphoto.com","IpAddress":"189.202.112.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1301343569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238291.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":99,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mandjphoto","Id":238291,"Name":"mandjphoto","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
