Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ba181b0141d2fe657633ea3babbf9fb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are planning on getting married April 6, 2012 and our guests and us will be staying at Occidental Grand Xcaret. They are booked for that date and so is Xcaret the park. We want a simple ceremony for about 20 people, flowers, officiant, music, photographer, cake on a beach. I&#039;m having a hard time finding just that. Can anyone help? Is this really going to cost me over $2,000 for a 20 minute ceremony?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1672610,"PostDate":1349884287,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are planning on getting married April 6, 2012 and our guests and us will be staying at Occidental Grand Xcaret. They are booked for that date and so is Xcaret the park. We want a simple ceremony for about 20 people, flowers, officiant, music, photographer, cake on a beach. I'm having a hard time finding just that. Can anyone help? Is this really going to cost me over $2,000 for a 20 minute ceremony?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stacy3reds@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1349883688,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261226.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stacy3reds","Id":261226,"Name":"stacy3reds","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f52d9c8a0c34f7e1d18a24c00913fb7","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]stacy3reds[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We are planning on getting married April 6, 2012 and our guests and us will be staying at Occidental Grand Xcaret. They are booked for that date and so is Xcaret the park. We want a simple ceremony for about 20 people, flowers, officiant, music, photographer, cake on a beach. I&#039;m having a hard time finding just that. Can anyone help? Is this really going to cost me over $2,000 for a 20 minute ceremony? \n \n Thanks![\/quote] \n Hello stacy3reds, \n \n As a wedding planner in the riviera maya, I am happy to send you a quote on the information your are looking for,  \n \n Please send me an email: weddingsinplayadelcarman@gmail.com . \n \n Feel free to ask me anything and I will be happy to help! \n \n Happy planning \n Joyce","Attachments":[],"Id":1674754,"PostDate":1350326144,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>stacy3reds<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We are planning on getting married April 6, 2012 and our guests and us will be staying at Occidental Grand Xcaret. They are booked for that date and so is Xcaret the park. We want a simple ceremony for about 20 people, flowers, officiant, music, photographer, cake on a beach. I'm having a hard time finding just that. Can anyone help? Is this really going to cost me over $2,000 for a 20 minute ceremony?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Hello stacy3reds,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As a wedding planner in the riviera maya, I am happy to send you a quote on the information your are looking for,\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Please send me an email: weddingsinplayadelcarman@gmail.com .<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Feel free to ask me anything and I will be happy to help!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy planning<\/p> <p> Joyce<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
